                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="187" value="&lt;b&gt;RULE:&lt;/b&gt; Codex decides task, boundaries, and capabilities. Jev routes. Prometheus assigns bounded work to configured agents; OMO coordinates. &lt;b&gt;Agent config decides model.&lt;/b&gt; The bridge never chooses a model pool." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E6;strokeColor=#F5A623;fontColor=#1E2630;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;arcSize=12;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
